            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Influence on Social Issues</strong><br>\nPrince Charles has influenced public debates on architecture, the environment, organic farming, and alternative medicine. His views have attracted both support and criticism, reflecting his active engagement with contemporary issues beyond his constitutional role.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Military Associations</strong><br>\nHe has served in the Royal Navy and the Royal Air Force. His military service concluded in the 1970s, but he continues to hold honorary ranks and participate in military ceremonies. This association underlines the historical ties between the monarchy and the armed forces.</p>\n\n<p><strong>International Role</strong><br>\nCharles has played an important international role, undertaking official visits to foster diplomatic relations. His work includes addressing global challenges such as climate change and religious tolerance, emphasizing the monarchy's role in international affairs.</p>\n"
              },
